-method","target_type":"occurrence","target_id":"occ-ishioka-matsuri-2020","assertion_code":"supports_occurrence","summary_ja":"常陸國總社宮は2020年9月15日に例祭祭典のみを斎行し、神輿・相撲・獅子・山車・ささらなどの神賑行事を延期すると決定した。","captured_at":"2026-08-02","review_status":"approved"},{"id":"evd-ishioka-matsuri-occ-2022","schema_version":"common.v1","record_version":1,"source_id":"src-ishioka-matsuri-2022-return","target_type":"occurrence","target_id":"occ-ishioka-matsuri-2022","assertion_code":"supports_occurrence","summary_ja":"常陸國總社宮は2022年9月15日の例祭と17日から19日の神幸祭・奉祝祭・還幸祭を通常通り行う日程を公開した。","captured_at":"2026-08-02","review_status":"approved"},{"id":"evd-ishioka-matsuri-occ-2026","schema_version":"common.v1","record_version":1,"source_id":"src-ishioka-matsuri-current-2026","target_type":"occurrence","target_id":"occ-ishioka-matsuri-2026","assertion_code":"supports_occurrence","summary_ja":"石岡市観光協会は2026年9月19日から21日の開催予定を公開している。結果は開催後に確認する。","captured_at":"2026-08-02","review_status":"approved"},{"id":"evd-ishioka-public-suspension-2020","schema_version":"common.v1","record_version":1,"source_id":"src-ishioka-matsuri-2020-method","target_type":"change_event","target_id":"chg-ishioka-public-suspension-2020","assertion_code":"supports_change_event","summary_ja":"神社公式発表は2020年に例祭祭典を維持しつつ市中の神賑行事を延期し、2022年発表はその延期が2年間続いたことを記録している。祭礼全体の停止とは扱わない。","captured_at":"2026-08-02","review_status":"approved"},{"id":"evd-ishioka-public-return-2022","schema_version":"common.v1","record_version":1,"source_id":"src-ishioka-matsuri-2022-return","target_type":"change_event","target_id":"chg-ishioka-public-return-2022","assertion_code":"supports_change_event","summary_ja":"常陸國總社宮は2022年に神輿渡御・御仮殿設営を含む神賑行事を感染対策の下で再開すると発表した。","captured_at":"2026-08-02","review_status":"approved"}],"images":[]}
